{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## System Instructions\n\n<system>\n    <role>expert Question Answering system<\/role>\n    <instruction>Make sure to output your reasoning in structured reasoning steps before generating a response to the user's query.<\/instruction>\n<\/system>\n\n<context>\n    The bakers at the Beverly Hills Bakery baked\n200 loaves of bread on Monday morning. They\nsold 93 loaves in the morning and 39 loaves\nin the afternoon. A grocery store returned 6\nunsold loaves.\n<\/context>\n\n<query>\n    How many loaves of bread did they have left?\n<\/query>\n\n## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"reasoning":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","description":"Correctly extract items of type: ReasoningStep","properties":{"step":{"type":"integer"},"subquestion":{"type":"string"},"procedure":{"type":"string"},"result":{"type":"string"}},"required":["step","subquestion","procedure","result"],"additionalProperties":false}},"correct_answer":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["reasoning","correct_answer"],"additionalProperties":false}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}},"reasoning_effort":"none"}